  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "とうぶの　すいほうで　ヘッドバット。\nちいさなポケモンで　あれば　そのまま\nすいほうに　とりこまれ　おぼれしぬ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "두부의 수포로 박치기한다.\n작은 포켓몬이라면 그대로\n수포에 싸여 익사한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用頭部的水泡來進行頭錘攻擊。\n如果是弱小的寶可夢，\n會被裹進水泡溺死。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se bat en donnant des « coups de bulle ».\nLes plus petits Pokémon peuvent se retrouver\npiégés à l’intérieur de sa bulle et mourir noyés.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es verteilt mit seiner Wasserblase Kopfstöße.\nKleine Pokémon werden dabei hineingezogen\nund ertrinken.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Propina cabezazos con su burbuja. Los\nPokémon de menor tamaño quedan atrapados\nen su interior y perecen ahogados.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Usa la bolla d’acqua sulla testa per dare delle\ntestate. I Pokémon di piccola taglia vengono\ndirettamente intrappolati nella bolla e affogano.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It delivers headbutts with the water bubble\non its head. Small Pokémon get sucked into\nthe bubble, where they drown.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "頭部の　水泡で　ヘッドバット。\n小さなポケモンで　あれば　そのまま\n水泡に　取り込まれ　溺れ死ぬ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用头部的水泡来进行撞头攻击。\n如果是弱小的宝可梦，\n就会被吸进水泡溺死。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Propina cabezazos con su burbuja. Los\nPokémon de menor tamaño quedan atrapados\nen su interior y perecen ahogados.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みかけに　よらず　めんどうみが　いい。\nよわく　ちいさな　なかまを　みつけると\nすいほうの　なかに　いれて　まもる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "겉보기와 다르게 주위를 잘 챙긴다.\n작고 약한 동료를 발견하면\n수포 안에 넣어서 지킨다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與外表不同，性格非常體貼。\n當發現弱小的夥伴時，\n會讓對方進入水泡來保護牠。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Bien plus attentionné qu’il n’y paraît, il n’hésite\npas à recueillir dans sa bulle ses camarades\nplus petits et fragiles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist fürsorglicher, als es aussieht. Findet es\neinen kleinen, schwachen Artgenossen, gewährt\nes ihm Einlass in seine Wasserblase.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es más atento de lo que parece. Si encuentra\na uno de los suyos débil o vulnerable, lo protege\nenvolviéndolo con su burbuja.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nonostante l’apparenza, è molto protettivo.\nQuando trova dei suoi simili più piccoli e deboli,\nli accoglie nella sua bolla d’acqua.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Despite what its appearance suggests, it cares\nfor others. If it finds vulnerable, weak Pokémon,\nit protectively brings them into its water bubble.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "見かけに　よらず　面倒見が　いい。\n弱く　小さな　仲間を　見つけると\n水泡の　中に　入れて　守る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "与外表不同，非常体贴。\n发现弱小的伙伴后，\n会让对方进入水泡，保护它。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es más atento de lo que parece. Si encuentra\na uno de los suyos débil o vulnerable, lo protege\nenvolviéndolo con su burbuja.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふだんは　みずのなかで　すごす。\nまんぷくの　とき　しとめた　えものは\nあたまの　すいほうに　しまっておく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "평소에는 물 안에서 지낸다.\n배가 부를 때는 숨통을 끊은 먹이를\n머리의 수포에 넣어 둔다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "平常在水中生活。\n肚子不餓的時候會把捉到的\n獵物收在頭部的水泡裡。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il passe la plupart de son temps dans l’eau.\nS’il est rassasié, il peut conserver ses proies\ndans sa bulle pour les manger plus tard.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es verlässt das Wasser nur sehr selten. Wenn es\nsatt ist, bewahrt es erledigte Beute in der\nWasserblase auf seinem Kopf auf.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pasa la mayor parte del tiempo en el agua.\nSi atrapa alguna presa sin tener hambre,\nla almacena en la burbuja de su cabeza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se ne sta per lo più in acqua. Quando è sazio,\nconserva le prede che ha catturato nella bolla\nche ha in testa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It usually passes its time in the water. When its\nbelly is full, it stores its subdued prey in the\nwater bubble on its head.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "普段は　水の中で　過ごす。\n満腹の　とき　仕留めた　獲物は\n頭の　水泡に　仕舞っておく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "平常就是水里生活。\n肚子饱的时候，会把抓获的猎物\n收纳在头部的水泡里。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pasa la mayor parte del tiempo en el agua.\nSi atrapa alguna presa sin tener hambre,\nla almacena en la burbuja de su cabeza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "だいじなものを　すいほうに　しまう\nしゅうせいがある。　ちゅういしないと\nトレーナーも　しまおうとしてくるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "중요한 것을 수포에 넣어 두는\n습성이 있다. 주의하지 않으면\n트레이너도 넣어 두려 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "有著把重要的東西收在水泡裡\n的習性。要是不注意的話，\n連訓練家都會被收進去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a pour habitude d’enfermer ce qui lui est cher\ndans sa bulle. Si son Dresseur n’est pas vigilant,\nTarenbulle essaiera de l’y ranger lui aussi !",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dinge, die ihm wichtig sind, pflegt es in seiner\nWasserblase aufzubewahren. Dazu gehört auch\nsein Trainer, wenn dieser nicht aufpasst.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Guarda en su burbuja todo lo que le es\npreciado. También intentará atrapar a su\nEntrenador si este se descuida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Conserva le cose importanti nella sua bolla\nd’acqua. Potrebbe provare a metterci anche\nil suo Allenatore, se questo non sta attento.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It has a habit of storing things it values in its\nwater bubble. If its Trainer doesn’t watch out,\nAraquanid will try to put them in its bubble!",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "大事なものを　水泡に　仕舞う\n習性がある。　注意しないと\nトレーナーも　仕舞おうとしてくるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "有着把重要的东西收纳在\n水泡里的习性。如果不注意，\n连训练家都会被放进去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Guarda en su burbuja todo lo que le es\npreciado. También intentará atrapar a su\nEntrenador si este se descuida.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
